  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_01",
      "hash64": "8DA4593E928F4587",
      "text": "¡Bienvenid[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa al Gimnasio de Pueblo Mestura!\\c\\n¿Quieres que te vuelva a explicar el examen de\\neste gimnasio?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_02",
      "hash64": "8DA45A3E928F473A",
      "text": "¡Pues se trata de [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]pedir una comanda secreta[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_03",
      "hash64": "8DA45B3E928F48ED",
      "text": "Para aprobar debes ir al establecimiento más\\npopular de Pueblo Mestura, el [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Mesón El Tesoro[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\r\\ny pedir la susodicha comanda secreta.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_04",
      "hash64": "8DA4543E928F3D08",
      "text": "En estos momentos, hay otros tres aspirantes\\nademás de ti realizando el examen de gimnasio.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_05",
      "hash64": "8DA4553E928F3EBB",
      "text": "A cada uno se le proporciona una pista distinta\\nsobre la comanda secreta.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_06",
      "hash64": "8DA4563E928F406E",
      "text": "Tendréis que enfrentaros en combate y el que\\npierda deberá revelar su pista al vencedor.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_07",
      "hash64": "8DA4573E928F4221",
      "text": "Una vez reunidas las pistas, cada aspirante\\ndeberá pedirle al camarero la comanda secreta\\r\\nen el Mesón El Tesoro.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_08",
      "hash64": "8DA4503E928F363C",
      "text": "Y, de entre todos, quien logre recibir la correcta\\nobtendrá el aprobado.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_09",
      "hash64": "8DA4513E928F37EF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], tu pista es la siguiente:\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]a gusto del cliente habitual[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_receptionist_10",
      "hash64": "8DA7DE3E92925D5D",
      "text": "Te recomiendo que hables con algún cliente\\nasiduo del mesón.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_01",
      "hash64": "AE31BE5429DB5DDF",
      "text": "Ñam, ñam... Slurp...[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_01",
      "hash64": "B588972BCEF95112",
      "text": "¿Eres cliente habitual?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_select_02",
      "hash64": "B588962BCEF94F5F",
      "text": "¿Eso es la comanda secreta?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02a",
      "hash64": "D9E80F031FC409E9",
      "text": "Hmm, ahora que lo dices... la verdad es que\\nvengo mucho por aquí, sí.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_03a",
      "hash64": "D9EAF3031FC6102C",
      "text": "¿Estás haciendo el examen de gimnasio,\\npor casualidad?[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 54,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_02b",
      "hash64": "D9E80C031FC404D0",
      "text": "Lo que he pedido no es nada del otro mundo,\\npero...[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_04",
      "hash64": "AE31B95429DB5560",
      "text": "Una cosa te diré, pues: un chorrito de [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]limón[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\nno le vendría nada mal a este plato. Le daría\\r\\nun toque fresco y ya estaría perfecto.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0038"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "gym_normal_020_normal_05",
      "hash64": "AE31BA5429DB5713",
      "text": "Un chorrito de [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]limón[VAR 0xFF00(0000)] no le vendría nada mal.\\nLe daría un toque fresco y ya estaría perfecto.\\c\\nAunque tal vez un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]a joven como tú preferiría\\necharle kétchup u otra anormalidad.[VAR 0x0114(0038)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
